<title>SRI LANKA: Distilleries Co up on local buying.</title>
<headline>Distilleries Co up on local buying.</headline>
<dateline>COLOMBO 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Distilleries Co of Sri Lanka Ltd rose 3.8 percent or 25 cents on local buying of 123,400 shares, brokers said.</p>
<p>&quot;There is a ... local investor who is buying the scrip, because it is good value at current levels,&quot; said one loccal broker.</p>
<p>The company is Sri Lanka's largest distiller and seller of alcohol. --Colombo newsroom (941) 434319</p>
</text>
